It's been a while since the last time I wrote or updated any patches, but
I have thought about this a little bit.. I haven't put together a new
version of the whole dump patch, but below is a quick and dirty incremental
diff against a source tree with my patch collection at
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nethack.html .
Like this, it remembers and dumps the latest 20 messages output with
pline. It seems to work, but is not necessarily very pretty.
All patchers, feel welcome to try it, but be prepared to back it out.
I will probably change something before updating the actual dump patch or my
combined diff, and I appreciate comments.

